          'deshalb (therefore, that is why) gives the consequence: first comes the reason, then the result. Tommy mag Tiger. Deshalb möchte er in den Zoo gehen. deshalb is in position 1, then comes the verb (position 2), then the subject. deshalb can also come after the verb: Er möchte deshalb in den Zoo gehen. Compare: weil gives the reason – Er möchte in den Zoo gehen, weil er Tiger mag.',
